  "title": "Loop Industries Announces Offtake Agreement with Taro Plast to Supply Loop™ Dimethyl Terephthalate (DMT) made from 100% Recycled Content",
  "summary": "MONTRÉAL, QC/ACCESSNEWSWIRE/SEPTEMBER 15TH, 2025 – Loop Industries, Inc. (Nasdaq: LOOP; “Loop”), a clean technology company whose mission is to accelerate a circular plastics economy by manufacturing 100% recycled polyethylene terephthalate (“PET”) plastic and textile-to-textile polyester fiber and Taro Plast S.p.A., (“Taro Plast”), a global leader in thermoplastic compounds, at the forefront of sustainability and innovation […]",
